Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 12:34:39 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1046/1286] The Writer's notebook; a right-click menu; actions
 on the Collection's cards

1047 the Writer's notebook (heresy-writer.js): documents with STYLE, LYRICS,
NOTES (Markdown, with a preview) and PARAMS (every knob of the Create form);
search over all four parts; autosave, a version per sitting, "Keep this
version" under a label; a version is read in place, restored or copied as
a new document. Both ways with Create: "Load into Create" puts the document
in hand, "Save to Writer" there keeps the song as tuned; takes made while a
document is in hand are linked to it and listed with it.

1048 the studio's own menu (heresy-menu.js) on a take, in the takes column
and in the Collection: play, Create, Post, sheet, like, dislike, favourite,
note, rename, workspaces, hide, Writer, copy, download, to the trash. The
Collection's cards carry like, dislike, favourite, Post and the menu; a
Post button on the takes column's cards. Tiles four across (three, two, one
on narrower screens). The column grip no longer shows over the Collection.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
